==History==
2023
*The Mortar's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 3/7/2023, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (3/7/2023)|July 2023 Update]].
2024
*On 5/2/2024, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/2/2024)|February 2024 Update]], changed the Evolved Mortar's sound effects.
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]], removed the Evolved Mortar's hitpoints boost.
*On 8/10/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/10/2024)|Balance Update]], added a 1 second delay in the Evolved Mortar's first attack.
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], added a sound effect to the Evolved Mortar after death.
2026

* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Evolved Mortar's Goblin Deploy Time to 0.5 seconds (from 0.2 seconds)
* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Evolved Mortar's hit speed to 4.7 seconds (from 4 seconds)

